**********Extracted claims**********

_The Witches and the Grinnygog_ is a British television series.
_The Witches and the Grinnygog_ was first aired in 1983.
_The Witches and the Grinnygog_ was released from 14 November 1983 to 19 December 1983.
Roy Russell created _The Witches and the Grinnygog_.
Diarmuid Lawrence directed _The Witches and the Grinnygog_.
Patricia Hayes starred in _The Witches and the Grinnygog_.
Adam Woodyatt starred in _The Witches and the Grinnygog_.
